===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
[[File:Flying_squirrel_in_a_tree.jpg|thumb|A flying squirrel gliding among branches.]]

# Any of 43 [[species]] of squirrel-like [[rodent]]s, which [[glide]] from tree to tree:
## The [[tribe]] {{taxfmt|Pteromyini|tribe}} within the family {{taxfmt|Sciuridae|family}}, which are true [[squirrel]]s.
## The [[family]] {{taxfmt|Anomaluridae|family}}, which are only distantly related to the squirrels.

